<title>JAPAN: M'bishi Oil 75,000 bpd topper to close til Oct 16.</title>
<headline>M'bishi Oil 75,000 bpd topper to close til Oct 16.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Oil Co Ltd said on Monday that the 75,000 barrels-per-day (bpd) crude distillation unit at its Kawasaki refinery near Tokyo will close on Tuesday for scheduled maintenance and resume operations on October 16.</p>
<p>A Mitsubishi spokesman also said that a 100,000 bpd topper at its Mizushima plant in western Japan will be back on line on Friday. The facility has been shut for maintenance checks since September 5.</p>
</text>
